        <mxCell id="k8s-svcs-note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#6B7280,#9CA3AF);fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="HPAs scale on CPU (metrics-server); the PDB keeps a pod up during node drains. Services call each other directly (e.g. order → http://credit:3000), passing the user&#39;s headers on. The proxies encrypt every call (mTLS) and only let each route&#39;s listed callers in (ADR-0012)." vertex="1">
