        <mxCell id="d4-state" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;gradientColor=none;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;fillColor=#7AA116;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.s3;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=light-dark(#1F2937,#E5E7EB);html=1;labelBackgroundColor=default;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;align=center;verticalAlign=top;" value="Terraform state (S3)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="48" width="48" x="820" y="928" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4-panel" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=12;fillColor=light-dark(#F9FAFB,#111827);strokeColor=light-dark(#D1D5DB,#374151);fontColor=light-dark(#1F2937,#E5E7EB);" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:light-dark(#7C3AED,#A78BFA);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Infrastructure (once, from a laptop)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#7C3AED,#A78BFA);&quot;&gt;I1&lt;/span&gt; Terraform apply:&lt;/b&gt; The developer runs Terraform with AWS SSO.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#7C3AED,#A78BFA);&quot;&gt;I2&lt;/span&gt; Remote state:&lt;/b&gt; State is stored and locked in an S3 bucket.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#7C3AED,#A78BFA);&quot;&gt;I3&lt;/span&gt; Provision:&lt;/b&gt; Terraform creates ECR, the OIDC role, VPC, EKS, RDS, S3 and CloudFront, then installs Argo CD in EKS pointed at the repo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Backend: CI/CD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;C1&lt;/span&gt; Pull request:&lt;/b&gt; The developer pushes a branch and opens a PR (frontend changes too).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;C2&lt;/span&gt; CI:&lt;/b&gt; The ci workflow runs the changed services&#39; tests, the frontend build and lints Terraform/Helm.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;C3&lt;/span&gt; Merge:&lt;/b&gt; Merging to main with service changes starts deploy-dev.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;C4&lt;/span&gt; OIDC login:&lt;/b&gt; deploy-dev swaps a GitHub OIDC token for short-lived credentials of IAM role foc-ci; no stored keys.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;C5&lt;/span&gt; Docker build:&lt;/b&gt; Each changed service is built for arm64, and a db migration image.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;C6&lt;/span&gt; Push:&lt;/b&gt; Images go to ECR tagged with the git commit SHA.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;C7&lt;/span&gt; Tag bump:&lt;/b&gt; A bot commits the new tag to deploy/values (the GitOps desired state).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Backend: GitOps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);&quot;&gt;G1&lt;/span&gt; Sync:&lt;/b&gt; Argo CD sees main change and renders the Helm charts.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/span&gt; Pre-sync hook:&lt;/b&gt; A migrate Job runs before the new version.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);&quot;&gt;G3&lt;/span&gt; Migrate:&lt;/b&gt; The Job applies schema migrations to RDS.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);&quot;&gt;G4&lt;/span&gt; Rollout:&lt;/b&gt; The Deployment does a rolling update to the new tag.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);&quot;&gt;G5&lt;/span&gt; Pull image:&lt;/b&gt; Nodes pull the image from ECR with their IAM role.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:10px 0 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Frontend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);&quot;&gt;F1&lt;/span&gt; Merge:&lt;/b&gt; Merging to main with frontend changes starts frontend-dev (after C1–C2).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);&quot;&gt;F2&lt;/span&gt; Build:&lt;/b&gt; frontend-dev builds the SPA with Vite.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);&quot;&gt;F3&lt;/span&gt; OIDC login:&lt;/b&gt; It assumes the same IAM role foc-ci via OIDC.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);&quot;&gt;F4&lt;/span&gt; Upload:&lt;/b&gt; Static files are synced to the S3 site bucket.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);&quot;&gt;F5&lt;/span&gt; Invalidate:&lt;/b&gt; CloudFront&#39;s cache is cleared so users get the new build.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="630" width="450" x="1290" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4-legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=12;fillColor=light-dark(#F9FAFB,#111827);strokeColor=light-dark(#D1D5DB,#374151);fontColor=light-dark(#1F2937,#E5E7EB);" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arrow colours&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#7C3AED,#A78BFA);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;━━━&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; Infrastructure (Terraform)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;━━━&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; Backend CI/CD (GitHub Actions)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;━━━&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; GitOps (Argo CD)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:3px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;━━━&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; Frontend (GitHub Actions)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;color:light-dark(#6B7280,#9CA3AF);&quot;&gt;dashed = pulled by the receiver (Argo CD polls git, nodes pull from ECR)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="450" x="1290" y="725" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
