        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="backend-panel" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;fillColor=light-dark(#F9FAFB,#111827);strokeColor=light-dark(#D1D5DB,#374151);fontColor=light-dark(#1F2937,#E5E7EB);" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:8px 0 4px 0;font-size:14px;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Backend CI/CD (GitHub Actions)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;①&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Pull request:&lt;/b&gt; The developer pushes a branch and opens a PR.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;②&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;CI:&lt;/b&gt; Tests the changed services and lints Terraform/Helm.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;③&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Merge:&lt;/b&gt; A merge to main with service changes starts deploy-dev.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;④&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Plan:&lt;/b&gt; Works out which services changed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑤&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;OIDC login:&lt;/b&gt; The build job assumes IAM role foc-ci. No stored keys.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑥&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Build and push:&lt;/b&gt; Docker builds the app and migrate images (arm64) and pushes them to ECR, tagged with the commit SHA.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑦&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Bump:&lt;/b&gt; After all builds pass, the bump job runs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#2563EB,#60A5FA);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑧&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Commit tag:&lt;/b&gt; A bot commits the new tag to deploy/values in git.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:8px 0 4px 0;font-size:14px;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;GitOps (Argo CD)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑨&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Detect:&lt;/b&gt; Argo CD polls git and sees the new tag.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑩&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Render:&lt;/b&gt; Renders the Helm chart and diffs it with the cluster.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑪&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Pre-sync:&lt;/b&gt; Runs the migrate Job first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑫&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Migrate:&lt;/b&gt; Applies schema migrations to RDS. On failure, the old version keeps running.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑬&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Apply:&lt;/b&gt; Updates the Deployment to the new tag.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑭&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Rolling update:&lt;/b&gt; New pods replace old ones once healthy.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#EA580C,#FB923C);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑮&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Pull image:&lt;/b&gt; Nodes pull the image from ECR.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="680" width="410" x="830" y="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
