        <mxCell id="frontend-panel" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;fillColor=light-dark(#F9FAFB,#111827);strokeColor=light-dark(#D1D5DB,#374151);fontColor=light-dark(#1F2937,#E5E7EB);" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin:8px 0 6px 0;font-size:14px;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Frontend (GitHub Actions)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;①&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Pull request:&lt;/b&gt; The developer pushes a branch and opens a PR.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;②&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;CI:&lt;/b&gt; The ci workflow builds the frontend to catch errors.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;③&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Merge:&lt;/b&gt; A merge to main with frontend changes starts frontend-dev.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;④&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Build:&lt;/b&gt; npm ci + Vite build the static site (dist/).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑤&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;OIDC login:&lt;/b&gt; The workflow assumes IAM role foc-ci. No stored keys.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑥&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Upload:&lt;/b&gt; Files are synced to the S3 bucket; index.html last, so it never points at missing files.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑦&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Invalidate:&lt;/b&gt; CloudFront clears its cache so users get the new build.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:light-dark(#059669,#34D399);font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;⑧&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;Serve:&lt;/b&gt; Users load the app from CloudFront, which reads the private bucket.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
